# Dataset and derived artifacts — never commit real audio/data (see docs/03_DATA_AND_EVALUATION_CONTRACT.md)
data/raw/
data/interim/
data/processed/
data/external/
artifacts/*
# artifacts/features_cache/ is intentionally tracked: extracted numeric
# features (log-mel stats etc.), not raw audio — needed by the Streamlit
# Cloud deploy to refit the frozen model (reports/model_freeze.md) without
# the real ICBHI dataset present.
!artifacts/features_cache/
# reports/figures/*.png is intentionally tracked: EDA/report plots are small,
# non-sensitive (class/device/duration distributions, no raw audio) and are
# the recruiter-facing evidence docs/06_RELEASE_AND_PORTFOLIO.md asks for.
# Model weight files exceed GitHub's 100MB limit and don't belong in git history
# per ADR-0001 D7 (weights are a versioned artifact loaded by sha256, e.g. HF Hub,
# not a committed binary). Only the hash (results/v2_frozen/v2_freeze.json) is
# tracked; the .pt file stays local.
results/v2_frozen/v2_model_state_dict.pt

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

